<view class="page fade-in editor-page">
  <view class="safe-top editor-head"><button class="back-button tap" bindtap="goBack"><app-icon name="arrow-left" size="22"/></button><view><view class="eyebrow">FEEDING PLANS</view><view class="title">{{isEdit ? '编辑方案' : '创建方案'}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="stepper"><text>第 {{step}} 步 / 3</text><view class="progress-dots"><view class="step-dot {{step >= 1 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-step="1" bindtap="goStep"></view><view class="step-dot {{step >= 2 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-step="2" bindtap="goStep"></view><view class="step-dot {{step >= 3 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-step="3" bindtap="goStep"></view></view></view>
  <scroll-view scroll-y show-scrollbar="{{false}}" class="editor-body">
    <view wx:if="{{step === 1}}" class="form-section"><view class="section-caption">01 / 适用对象</view><view class="section-title">先定义这套方案适合谁</view><view class="section-copy">用品种和成长阶段，帮助你在鸟详情里快速匹配。</view><view class="field-card"><text>方案名称</text><input data-key="name" value="{{form.name}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="如：玄凤无毛雏鸟 0月7天"/></view><view class="field-card"><text>适用品种</text><input data-key="species" value="{{form.species}}" bindinput="input" bindfocus="focusBreed" placeholder="输入或从已有品种中选择"/><view wx:if="{{breedOptions.length}}" class="breed-options"><text wx:for="{{breedOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="breed-option tap" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="chooseBreed">{{item}}</text></view></view><view class="field-card"><text>生长阶段</text><input data-key="stage" value="{{form.stage}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="如：无毛雏鸟、绒毛期"/></view><view class="age-card"><view class="age-card-head"><text>适用年龄</text><text>月龄可为 0</text></view><view class="age-range"><view class="age-point"><text>从</text><view class="age-inputs"><input type="number" data-key="ageFromMonths" value="{{form.ageFromMonths}}" bindinput="input"/><text>月</text><input type="number" data-key="ageFromDays" value="{{form.ageFromDays}}" bindinput="input"/><text>天</text></view></view><view class="age-arrow">→</view><view class="age-point"><text>到</text><view class="age-inputs"><input type="number" data-key="ageToMonths" value="{{form.ageToMonths}}" bindinput="input"/><text>月</text><input type="number" data-key="ageToDays" value="{{form.ageToDays}}" bindinput="input"/><text>天</text></view></view></view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{step === 2}}" class="form-section"><view class="section-caption">02 / 食物方案</view><view class="section-title">这只鸟吃什么</view><view class="section-copy">选择食物组合后，只填写真正需要交代给买家的内容。</view><view class="feeding-types"><view class="feeding-type {{form.feedingType === 'FORMULA' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-type="FORMULA" bindtap="chooseFeedingType"><text>奶粉</text><view>冲泡喂养</view></view><view class="feeding-type {{form.feedingType === 'MIXED' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-type="MIXED" bindtap="chooseFeedingType"><text>奶粉 + 谷子</text><view>过渡搭配</view></view><view class="feeding-type {{form.feedingType === 'SOLID' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-type="SOLID" bindtap="chooseFeedingType"><text>谷子 / 固体</text><view>可直接进食</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{form.feedingType !== 'SOLID'}}" class="food-block"><view class="food-block-title">奶粉与冲泡</view><view class="field-card"><text>奶粉名称</text><input data-key="formulaName" value="{{form.formulaName}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="品牌 / 型号"/></view><view class="split-fields"><view class="field-card"><text>水量（ml）</text><input type="number" data-key="waterMl" value="{{form.waterMl}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field-card"><text>奶粉勺数</text><input data-key="powderScoops" value="{{form.powderScoops}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="如：3平勺"/></view></view><view class="split-fields"><view class="field-card"><text>最低水温</text><input type="number" data-key="temperatureMin" value="{{form.temperatureMin}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field-card"><text>最高水温</text><input type="number" data-key="temperatureMax" value="{{form.temperatureMax}}" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="note-card"><text>怎么判断水温</text><textarea data-key="temperatureCheck" value="{{form.temperatureCheck}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="如：温度计测量；不可凭手感代替温度计"/></view><view class="note-card"><text>冲泡说明</text><textarea data-key="preparationNotes" value="{{form.preparationNotes}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="冲泡顺序、搅拌和保存要求"/></view></view><view wx:if="{{form.feedingType !== 'FORMULA'}}" class="food-block"><view class="food-block-title">谷子 / 固体食物</view><view class="field-card"><text>食物名称</text><input data-key="seedFoodName" value="{{form.seedFoodName}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="如：泡软小米、滋养丸"/></view><view class="field-card"><text>每日参考量</text><input data-key="seedFoodAmount" value="{{form.seedFoodAmount}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="如：早晚各 1 小勺 / 自由采食"/></view><view class="note-card"><text>处理与过渡说明</text><textarea data-key="seedFoodNotes" value="{{form.seedFoodNotes}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="是否泡软、是否需要逐日替换奶粉、饮水要求等"/></view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{step === 3}}" class="form-section"><view class="section-caption">03 / 喂养观察</view><view class="section-title">让买家知道怎么做、怎么判断</view><view class="section-copy">记录每次喂养的节奏，以及需要特别留意的边界。</view><view class="split-fields"><view class="field-card"><text>每天次数</text><input type="number" data-key="feedingsPerDay" value="{{form.feedingsPerDay}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field-card"><text>单次参考量</text><input data-key="amountMl" value="{{form.amountMl}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="如：8–10ml"/></view></view><view class="field-card"><text>喂养方式</text><input data-key="feedingMethod" value="{{form.feedingMethod}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="针管 / 勺子"/></view><view class="note-card"><text>操作与注意事项</text><textarea data-key="feedingNotes" value="{{form.feedingNotes}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="姿势、速度、针管或勺子的注意点"/></view><view class="note-card"><text>怎么判断喂够</text><textarea data-key="fullnessNotes" value="{{form.fullnessNotes}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="嗉囊、精神、排空等观察点"/></view><view class="note-card"><text>异常提醒</text><textarea data-key="warningNotes" value="{{form.warningNotes}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="拒食、呛食、嗉囊异常时的处理边界"/></view><button wx:if="{{isEdit && !plan.isEnabled}}" class="delete-plan" bindtap="remove">删除此方案</button></view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="form-footer"><button wx:if="{{step > 1}}" class="previous" bindtap="previousStep">上一步</button><button class="next button-dark" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="nextStep">{{step === 3 ? '保存方案' : '下一步'}} <text wx:if="{{step !== 3}}">→</text></button></view>
</view>
